
# Employee Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project uses Microsoft Excel to analyse employee attendance, performance scores and completed tasks.

The dashboard helps management monitor employee performance and compare results across departments.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Excel formulas
- Conditional Formatting
- Data Validation
- Charts and dashboards

## Excel Skills Demonstrated
- IF and COUNTIF
- AVERAGE and AVERAGEIF
- MAX and MIN
- Data cleaning and validation
- KPI calculations
- Department performance analysis
- Dashboard visualisation

## Dashboard KPIs
- Total Employees: 15
- Average Attendance: 80.47%
- Average Performance: 72.93
- Employees Passing: 9
- Employees Needing Support: 6

## Project Sheets
1. Employee_Data
2. Performance_Summary
3. Dashboard

## Learning Outcome
Developed practical Excel skills in data analysis, reporting and dashboard creation.

